{
  "name": "Trellis Video Ad Generator v5",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🎬 Trellis Video Ad Generator v5 — SETUP\n\nEngine: **Kling v2.6 Pro (fal.ai)** — renders video **+ lip-synced audio in one call**.\n\n### 1) Create these credentials\nThe flagged nodes need them:\n\n**Fal.ai API** → type *Header Auth*\n• Name:  `Authorization`\n• Value: `Key YOUR_FAL_KEY`\n(Submit Kling / Poll Status / Fetch Result)\n\n**Gemini API** → type *Query Auth*\n• Name:  `key`\n• Value: `YOUR_GEMINI_KEY`\n(Generate Script)\n\n**Sproutify Trellis** (Supabase) — already exists; re-select if a node shows it unset.\n\n### 2) ⚠️ Rotate leaked keys FIRST\nv4 had Gemini / Fal.ai / ElevenLabs keys hardcoded in plaintext. Rotate all three before going live.\n\n### 3) Activate\nDelete/disable the old **v4** first (it holds the same webhook path), then toggle this workflow **Active**.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "note-setup-0001",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1360,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Webhook contract\n\n`POST https://n8n.sproutify.app/webhook/trellis-video-ad-generate`\n\nBody (sent by the Trellis app → Video Ad Lab):\n```\njob_id, branch, product_description,\ntarget_segment, tone, cta, actor_style,\nactor_gender, voice_id, voice_style,\nvideo_duration, pipeline ('talking_head'\n| 'full_scene'), platform\n```\nResponds **instantly** (async) — the app polls `video_ad_jobs` for status/progress.\n\n**DB prereq (already done on the Hub):** `video_ad_jobs.updated_at` column + heartbeat trigger.\n\n**Branch lookup:** prefix match, so both bare slugs (`rekkrd`) and domain keys (`rekkrd.com`) in `brand_profiles` resolve.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "note-io-0002",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -900,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Reliability (why v5 wont zombie)\n• Every generation node has an **error branch → Mark Failed** (writes `status=failed` + `error_message`).\n• Poll loop is **bounded**: Wait 20s → Poll → not done → Bump Progress → **Timed Out? (30 tries ≈ 10 min)** → fail.\n• Progress climbs each poll (45→95%) so it never looks frozen.\n• Executions are saved (Settings) so failures are visible.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "note-loop-0003",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Reliability",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        760
      ]
    },
